WEBVTT

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:09.660
Lua is...

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.230
Lua is a Signer?

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:28.400
Lua!

00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:34.660
No way...  This kid evolved into a Signer?

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:45.520
Level 1 Morphtronic Lantron 
tunes Level 7 Power Tool Dragon!

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:46.880
What?

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:51.220
In order to protect the future of the world, 
courage and power have a revolution!

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:53.770
Crimson Dragon!

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:54.800
No way!

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:56.970
Synchro Summon!

00:00:57.210 --> 00:01:00.440
Evolve, Life Stream Dragon!

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:23.690
This is Signer Lua's new dragon.

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:41.530
Evolution? Whatever.

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:43.780
I won't forgive you for Synchro Summoning!

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.050
Asterisk's effect activates!

00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:50.500
Since you Synchro Summoned, 
you take 1000 points of damage!

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:54.830
Since I have Life Stream Dragon,
I don't take damage from an effect!

00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:01.770
What?

00:02:01.940 --> 00:02:04.350
Luca, I'll save you!

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:08.920
When Life Stream Dragon is 
successfully Synchro Summoned,

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:11.840
players with 2000 or fewer life points 
will now have 2000 life points!

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:12.800
What?

00:02:25.140 --> 00:02:27.230
My life is...

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:28.200
Luca!

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:33.500
Luca...  Thank goodness.

00:02:34.530 --> 00:02:36.650
Why am I...

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:45.750
This is the dragon that 
appeared in my dreams.

00:02:48.170 --> 00:02:48.880
Lua, what's that?

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:54.800
By trying hard, I turned into a Signer.

00:02:55.670 --> 00:02:56.890
Are you surprised?

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:58.350
I'm not surprised.

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:03.180
Because you've always protected me, Lua.

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:06.860
Because you always thought 
of me before yourself.

00:03:07.170 --> 00:03:11.070
That will never change 
because you're my hero, Lua.

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:13.770
A hero shouldn't cry.

00:03:13.770 --> 00:03:18.140
Crimson Dragon chose Lua 
because he would risk his life

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:20.060
for those he loves.

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:20.800
Stop it!

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:22.460
Pathetic.

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:24.730
2000 life points only provides a breather.

00:03:24.730 --> 00:03:26.920
It's a false hope!

00:03:27.050 --> 00:03:28.260
Don't you understand?

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:31.040
You tried to make Lua despair.

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:34.630
But Lua snatched hope from despair!

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:37.400
There's hope beyond despair!

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:39.530
Lua evolved into a Signer!

00:03:39.850 --> 00:03:41.600
That's our hope!

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:43.800
Whatever!

00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:46.940
I won't let go of hope!

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:51.280
Life Stream Dragon attacks 
Meklord Astro Dragon Asterisk!

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:55.710
Life is Beautiful!

00:03:57.680 --> 00:03:59.700
Riding Duels.

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:02.620
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:09.250
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:16.960
Run!  The road of evolution leading to tomorrow

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:21.340
Is a new legendary duel

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:38.430
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:44.060
Set free your infinite potential

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:49.450
Every beginning is up to you

00:04:50.030 --> 00:04:55.990
Everyone is lost  Pursue the light

00:04:56.630 --> 00:05:01.360
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:05:01.930 --> 00:05:07.190
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:05:09.460 --> 00:05:14.990
Become the gale and dance  Cut through the darkness

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:20.360
Even if you can't see your destination

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:25.890
Run on your feet without fear

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:31.430
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:38.470
Going my way!!  Break through and go!

00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:58.440
Miracle of Life,
Life Stream Dragon!!

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:01.570
I won't let go of hope!

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:05.910
Life Stream Dragon attacks 
Meklord Astro Dragon Asterisk!

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:10.400
Life is Beautiful!

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:13.820
Asterisk's effect activates!

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:18.290
I send one Machine-Type monster 
on my field to the graveyard

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:20.630
to negate Asterisk's destruction.

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:23.360
I send Meklord Army of 
Skiel to the graveyard!

00:06:24.800 --> 00:06:26.730
But you still take damage!

00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:33.950
It seems the pain in your heart has returned.

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:37.050
I threw away my heart!

00:06:37.050 --> 00:06:38.780
I quit being human!

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:41.950
I no longer feel pain or despair in my heart.

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:46.080
Since I received an attack 
from a Synchro Monster,

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:49.440
I activate the Continuous
Trap Cursed Synchro.

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:53.700
Synchro Monsters can no longer attack!

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:55.900
He's now preventing us from attacking.

00:06:55.900 --> 00:06:59.790
I won't let Synchro Monsters 
do whatever they like.

00:07:00.170 --> 00:07:03.430
I no longer feel despair!

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:05.850
I set one card.

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:07.380
You fool!

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:09.380
Due to Lock On Laser's effect,

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:13.780
if you set a spell or trap card,
 you take 200 points of damage!

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:18.020
Since I have Life Stream Dragon,
effect damage is negated!

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:25.610
My turn!

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:29.400
Kuribon!  Thank you.

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:31.380
I'm okay now.

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:36.250
Ancient Fairy Dragon's 
effect activates!

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:39.850
Once per turn, I can destroy a Field Spell.

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:42.170
I destroy Fortissimo the Mobile Fortress!

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:44.850
I'm counting on you,
Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:46.140
Brain Back!

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:55.850
How dare you!

00:07:56.050 --> 00:08:02.030
I regain 1000 life points, and I add 
one Field Spell in my deck to my hand!

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:05.050
Then I activate the Field 
Spell Synchro Monument

00:08:05.050 --> 00:08:06.900
that was added to my hand!

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:16.910
When a Tuner Monster or 
Synchro Monster is summoned,

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:19.510
you can't activate a card.

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:21.110
Nice, Luca!

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:23.480
Now we can safely use Synchros!

00:08:23.780 --> 00:08:26.400
Stop your Synchro Summons!

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:29.450
You're trying to make me despair again!

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:33.460
It seems you still don't 
understand, so I'll teach you!

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:35.160
My turn!

00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:38.860
I flip over my trap card
Descending Lost Star!

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:42.830
I Special Summon a Synchro Monster
from my graveyard in defense position.

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:45.800
Resurrect, Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:50.710
Its effects are negated,

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:53.280
its defense points become 0 
and its Level decreases by 1.

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:56.380
I activate Red Dragon Vase from my hand.

00:08:56.450 --> 00:09:01.190
When Red Dragon Archfiend is 
on my field, I draw two cards.

00:09:01.300 --> 00:09:04.950
Then I activate the spell 
card Scarlet Security!

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:07.840
Since I have Red Dragon Archfiend,

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:13.100
all faceup spell and trap cards 
on your field are destroyed!

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:15.570
Stop it!

00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:19.650
Stop it...

00:09:20.510 --> 00:09:23.580
I activate the spell card Resonator Call!

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:26.640
I add a Resonator monster to my hand!

00:09:27.280 --> 00:09:30.230
I add Creation Resonator!

00:09:30.230 --> 00:09:35.020
I can Special Summon it when a
Synchro Monster is on my field.

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:35.950
Come!

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:38.660
Creation Resonator!

00:09:40.290 --> 00:09:43.550
Then I summon Dread Dragon!

00:09:48.410 --> 00:09:51.870
My rugged soul, Burning Soul!

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:56.910
Level 2 Dread Dragon and Level 3 
Creation Resonator double tunes

00:09:56.910 --> 00:10:00.580
Level 7 Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:03.550
The king and devil now merge here!

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:05.510
Rugged soul!

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:08.180
Give the roar that created
heaven and earth!

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:10.490
Synchro Summon!

00:10:10.900 --> 00:10:13.420
Come, Red Nova Dragon!

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:17.700
For every Tuner Monster in my graveyard,

00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:21.620
Red Nova Dragon gains 500 attack points!

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:24.800
There are four Tuner 
Monsters in my graveyard!

00:10:25.110 --> 00:10:26.750
Therefore, its attack points are...

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:30.770
All right!

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:32.510
5500 attack points!

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:38.120
Red Nova Dragon attacks Asterisk!

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:42.490
I won't despair!

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:45.690
I flip over my trap card Chaos Infinity!

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:49.660
All monsters in defense position
switch to attack position!

00:10:51.370 --> 00:10:53.250
Then I Special Summon a Meklord monster

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:58.080
from my graveyard and from my
deck by negating its effects!

00:10:58.320 --> 00:11:02.200
Come, Meklord Army of Skiel 
and Meklord Astro Mekanikle!

00:11:03.020 --> 00:11:05.370
Asterisk gains attack points equal to

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:09.740
the total points of my new
monsters in attack position!

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:14.520
8300 attack points?

00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:16.650
I will no longer despair!

00:11:17.060 --> 00:11:19.190
You're the ones who will despair!

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:22.990
Look at these overwhelming attack points!

00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:27.200
Humans, you'll learn how powerless 
you are at the edge of despair!

00:11:27.510 --> 00:11:31.670
Then entrust the future of humanity to Z-one!

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:34.250
I still won't despair!

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:37.650
I flip over my trap card Synchro Big Tornado!

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:42.060
One of your monsters loses
attack points equal to

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:44.750
my Synchro Monster Life Stream
Dragon's defense points!

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:49.520
Even if it loses 2400 points,

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:53.690
Asterisk has more attack 
points than Red Nova Dragon!

00:11:54.200 --> 00:11:57.600
I flip over my Counter Trap Fairy Breath!

00:11:57.810 --> 00:12:01.480
When Ancient Fairy Dragon is on my field,

00:12:01.480 --> 00:12:06.170
one monster gains 3000 defense 
points until the End Phase!

00:12:06.170 --> 00:12:07.370
What?

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:16.910
Our thoughts are with you, Jack!

00:12:29.420 --> 00:12:30.590
Why?

00:12:30.590 --> 00:12:33.440
I quit being human, so 
why does my heart hurt?

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:37.240
Do I still struggle with despair?

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:41.820
No, you do not despair
because you have hope.

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:43.570
What are you talking about?

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:49.320
Just like Lua fought for 
Luca, you fought for Z-one.

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:53.920
As long as you have hope for 
Z-one, you won't despair!

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:56.310
We have hope in Yusei!

00:12:56.660 --> 00:12:58.660
That's why we won't despair either!

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:04.660
Red Nova Dragon attacks Meklord 
Astro Dragon Asterisk!

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:07.230
Burning Soul!

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:30.770
Let's escape!

00:13:30.770 --> 00:13:31.640
Yeah!

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:40.170
Hang on tight!

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:58.610
The Yusei Gear stopped.

00:13:58.610 --> 00:13:59.620
We did it!

00:14:07.770 --> 00:14:09.040
Aporia...

00:14:11.090 --> 00:14:14.280
This pain isn't despair...

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:17.350
No...  It's not pain...

00:14:18.060 --> 00:14:20.440
This aching is...

00:14:23.570 --> 00:14:24.520
Hope.

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:37.320
It's clearly falling.

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:38.800
If nothing changes...

00:14:40.110 --> 00:14:41.550
It's too dangerous now!

00:14:41.550 --> 00:14:43.610
You also must flee immediately!

00:14:44.970 --> 00:14:47.380
We haven't finished evacuating the citizens.

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:51.020
Forget the rest and 
get yourselves to safety!

00:14:51.310 --> 00:14:52.360
We're not giving up!

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:56.490
Our job is to save as many 
citizens as possible!

00:14:56.800 --> 00:14:58.180
But...

00:14:58.590 --> 00:15:02.800
Even they're trying their
best inside that thing.

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:05.850
We can't be the only ones to flee.

00:15:07.250 --> 00:15:10.820
Stop it no matter what, Yusei Fudo!

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:16.030
How far does this road go?

00:15:16.610 --> 00:15:17.490
We're almost there.

00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:27.170
Why are you helping us?

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:34.110
Even though you scanned this place,
how do you know so much about it?

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:35.380
I don't know.

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:38.600
I don't know why,
but I do know this place.

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:42.650
And I feel that the answer is ahead.

00:15:43.180 --> 00:15:44.510
At the Yusei Gear?

00:15:46.530 --> 00:15:51.320
Crow and Jack battled against duelists 
who were protecting the Yusei Gears.

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:52.960
That means...

00:15:53.240 --> 00:15:55.310
There will be an enemy
that we must defeat.

00:15:55.750 --> 00:16:00.670
By defeating that enemy, the road 
to the Sun Gear opens, and...

00:16:01.220 --> 00:16:02.870
You'll learn who you are?

00:16:04.570 --> 00:16:05.340
We're here!

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:31.340
Where's our opponent?

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:34.210
Where's the enemy that we must defeat?

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:45.080
What is it?

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:56.660
It's dangerous!  Step back!

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:10.410
This is...

00:17:16.980 --> 00:17:18.320
Hey!

00:17:20.140 --> 00:17:21.220
Are you okay?

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:24.480
Hey!

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:25.350
Everything...

00:17:27.980 --> 00:17:30.630
I remember everything.

00:17:32.850 --> 00:17:36.330
I remember the entire mission
that was assigned to me.

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:37.700
Mission?

00:17:38.860 --> 00:17:40.760
The enemy that you must battle...

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:44.980
...is me!

00:17:45.240 --> 00:17:48.260
Bruno!  It was you?

00:17:48.710 --> 00:17:50.580
My name is Antinomy.

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:54.690
And the guardian of this Yusei 
Gear and the Ark Cradle.

00:17:54.690 --> 00:17:55.890
Antinomy?

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:58.230
Guardian of the Ark Cradle?

00:17:58.680 --> 00:17:59.820
That's nonsense!

00:17:59.820 --> 00:18:02.660
You're our friend Bruno.

00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:03.630
You're wrong!

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:06.630
I'm Antinomy, a member
of Z-one's team!

00:18:07.010 --> 00:18:09.330
I won't let you proceed any further.

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:12.280
You're the enemy I have to defeat?

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:13.410
That's right!

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:19.340
The reason why I joined your 
team was to use your power

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:23.770
to call Ark Cradle and 
destroy Neo Domino City.

00:18:24.740 --> 00:18:27.520
You tricked us?

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:35.550
The reason you hid your identity 
and helped us out various times

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:37.400
was in order to trick us?

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:39.860
That seems to be the outcome.

00:18:40.230 --> 00:18:41.310
The outcome?

00:18:41.830 --> 00:18:45.870
In order to gain your full trust 
and join your team,

00:18:46.360 --> 00:18:49.570
Z-one erased my memories as Antinomy.

00:18:49.760 --> 00:18:55.280
The only memory remaining was my 
mission to protect and help you.

00:18:55.700 --> 00:18:56.980
That means...

00:18:56.980 --> 00:19:03.450
Until I arrived here, I thought that I 
was your ally and a member of Team 5D's.

00:19:03.680 --> 00:19:06.060
But I now remember everything.

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:07.680
Bruno...

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:10.020
You fought well.

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:14.820
Your power triggered 
the arrival of Ark Cradle.

00:19:15.370 --> 00:19:18.000
Only the destruction of 
Neo Domino City remains.

00:19:18.390 --> 00:19:22.470
And then everything will end, 
and the future will change!

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:25.730
Why are you doing this?

00:19:26.590 --> 00:19:27.760
Bruno!

00:19:34.030 --> 00:19:35.430
Let's hurry, Aki!

00:19:35.430 --> 00:19:35.990
Right.

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:42.490
I have a bad feeling...

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:45.220
Unless you defeat me,

00:19:45.220 --> 00:19:49.730
you will not be able to stop the 
Yusei Gear or go to the Sun Gear.

00:19:50.720 --> 00:19:54.810
The only path you have left is to battle me.

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:57.280
Battle you?

00:19:57.650 --> 00:20:00.810
If you don't beat me and proceed further,

00:20:00.810 --> 00:20:03.000
you won't be able to save Neo Domino City.

00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:07.520
However, my mission is to 
not let you proceed further.

00:20:07.740 --> 00:20:10.250
Why do we have to battle?

00:20:10.570 --> 00:20:12.960
Just like how you can't
betray your friends,

00:20:12.960 --> 00:20:16.230
I can't betray the mission 
that Z-one gave me.

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:18.960
Isn't there any other way, Bruno?

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:21.980
I'm Antinomy!

00:20:22.340 --> 00:20:24.200
Now battle, Yusei!

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:35.420
That's right.

00:20:35.890 --> 00:20:39.480
I must protect my 
friends and everyone!

00:20:39.720 --> 00:20:40.690
Bruno!

00:20:41.100 --> 00:20:42.350
No, Antinomy!

00:20:42.660 --> 00:20:45.080
I came here to stop this!

00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:49.930
If there's an enemy standing in my way, 
then I will defeat him no matter who he is!

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:51.180
Good.

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:56.770
If you're unsure about battling me, 
you'll never be able to defeat Z-one.

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:01.340
Come, Yusei!

00:21:05.050 --> 00:21:06.310
Duel Mode on.

00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:09.250
What's this?

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:13.450
This is a death course that's 
suited for your demise.

00:21:13.650 --> 00:21:14.300
Look!

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:20.730
What's that?

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:23.650
The loser will be swallowed
 into it and vanish!

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:24.500
What?

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:29.090
This duel doesn't end until 
one of us loses and vanishes.

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:31.600
You can't escape from this space!

00:21:37.350 --> 00:21:39.510
Here we go, Yusei Fudo!

00:21:41.350 --> 00:21:42.300
Duel!

00:22:05.210 --> 00:22:10.410
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:10.550 --> 00:22:15.780
If we shed the same tears, let's laugh together

00:22:15.910 --> 00:22:21.150
Freed reality forms phrases in the piercing beat

00:22:21.280 --> 00:22:23.880
Our hearts resonate

00:22:23.880 --> 00:22:29.110
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:29.250 --> 00:22:35.750
We'll find a place for us

00:22:37.650 --> 00:22:42.510
Waking in a dream  Stretch our hands toward the future

00:22:42.510 --> 00:22:47.580
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:48.310 --> 00:22:53.750
Repaint the darkness with the colors we envision

00:22:53.750 --> 00:23:02.310
Overlaying memories, bonds and hope creates future color

00:23:02.310 --> 00:23:07.920
We will draw it forever
